      "type": "mcq",
      "marks": 1,
      "q": "If $P(x,y)$ be any point on $16x^2+25y^2=400$ with foci $F_1(3,0)$ and $F_2(-3,0)$, then $PF_1+PF_2$ is :",
      "options": [
        "10",
        "8",
        "12",
        "6"
      ],
      "answer": 0,
      "solution": "$\\dfrac{x^2}{25}+\\dfrac{y^2}{16}=1$, so $a=5$. For any point on an ellipse $PF_1+PF_2=2a=10$."
    },
    {
      "id": "tn12m-con-24q12",
